格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"微信 ClawBot 通道插件增强版：多会话、斜杠命令、每会话模型、并发修复。把微信变成你的 AI 代理指挥中心。","id":"gh:1337877349","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-clawbot","slug":"tangwenhao616-netizen/dsh-clawbot","topics":["ai-agent","chatbot","clawbot","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","ilink","plugin","wechat","wechat-bot","weixin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"微信 ClawBot 通道插件增强版：多会话、斜杠命令、每会话模型、并发修复。把微信变成你的 AI 代理指挥中心。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-clawbot"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Turn your WeChat into an AI agent command center.** Scan a QR code, chat with DeepSeek Harness d"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"irectly from WeChat — no extra apps, no servers, no bridges."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What is dsh-clawbot?"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`dsh-clawbot` is a **WeChat channel plugin** for DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`). It connects your personal"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" WeChat to a running `dsh` agent via Tencent's official ClawBot (iLink) protocol."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**The problem it solves:** You want to talk to your AI agent from your phone, but you don't want to "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"deploy a public web UI, open ports, or install another app. With `dsh-clawbot`, you just scan a QR c"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ode in WeChat and start chatting — your agent runs locally, replies come back through WeChat."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Why not the original `dsh-weixin`?"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"This is a **community-enhanced fork** of `caoyilearnai/dsh-weixin` `v0.2.1` with production-grade im"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"*community-enhanced fork** of `caoyilearnai/dsh-weixin` `v0.2.1` with production-grade improvements:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Pain Point | Original | dsh-clawbot |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| One message blocks everything | ❌ Single-threaded | ✅ Per-user queues, parallel turns |\n| One user"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" = one session | ❌ 1:1 mapping | ✅ Multiple named sessions per user |\n| Switch models | ❌ Global onl"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"y | ✅ Per-session model, live switch |\n| Manage sessions | ❌ Delete state files | ✅ `/new` `/list` `"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"/use` `/del` commands |\n| Image handling | ⚠️ Poisons history | ✅ Vision-aware injection |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Quick Start (5 minutes)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Prerequisites"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness installed (`dsh` command available)\n- WeChat ≥ 8.0.70 (iOS) with ClawBot enabled:"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" **Settings → Plugins → ClawBot**"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 1. Install the plugin"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 2. Start dsh web"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### 3. Scan the QR code"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Open `http://127.0.0.1:3080/weixin` → click **\"扫码登录\"** → scan with WeChat."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### 4. Chat"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Send any message to the bot in WeChat. Each WeChat user gets an independent Harness session."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- **Multi-session**: One WeChat user can own multiple independent sessions. Switch with `/2` or `#wo"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"rk 帮我写周报`\n- **Slash commands**: `/new` `/list` `/use` `/model` `/rename` `/del` `/tag` `/help` — no "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"web UI needed\n- **Per-session model**: Each session remembers its own `provider/model`. Change with "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"`/model 3`, live on next turn\n- **Concurrency-safe**: Per-user inbound queues, per-message collector"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"s — no cross-talk, no blocking\n- **Rich media**: Text, voice (auto-transcribed by Tencent), images ("},{"id":"p25s6","text":"vision-model aware injection)\n- **Typing indicator**: Shows \"正在输入…\" while the agent thinks\n- **Activ"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"e push**: `ctx.weixin.push()` + `/weixin/send` HTTP endpoint + `push_weixin` tool for proactive mess"},{"id":"p25s8","text":"ages\n- **Secure by default**: Credentials stored with `0600` permissions, atomic writes, rate-limit "},{"id":"p25s9","text":"**Secure by default**: Credentials stored with `0600` permissions, atomic writes, rate-limit backoff"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Documentation"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Configuration\n- Slash Commands\n- Active Push\n- State Directory\n- Security Notes\n- Message Type Sup"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nfiguration\n- Slash Commands\n- Active Push\n- State Directory\n- Security Notes\n- Message Type Support"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Configuration"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Override defaults in your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Key | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `cwd` | `stateDir/workspace` | Working directory for new sessions |\n| `stateDir` | `$DSH_HOME/dsh-"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"weixin` | Credentials / session map / cursor directory |\n| `replyMode` | `full` | `full` = whole tur"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"n text / `last` = final message only |\n| `replyTimeoutMs` | `900000` | Single-turn reply timeout (ms"},{"id":"p32s4","text":") |\n| `maxChunk` | `1500` | Max characters per WeChat message (auto-split) |\n| `sendIntervalMs` | `2"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"000` | Min interval between sends (iLink rate limit) |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Slash Commands"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| Command | Description |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"| `/new [name]` | Create a new session and switch to it |\n| `/list` | List all your sessions |\n| `/2"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"` | Quick switch to session #2 |\n| `#name content` | Talk to a specific session directly |\n| `/model"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"` | List available models |\n| `/model <n>` | Switch current session to model #n |\n| `/rename <name>`"},{"id":"p35s4","text":" | Rename current session |\n| `/del <n>` | Delete session #n |\n| `/tag on\\|off` | Toggle session tag"},{"id":"p35s5","text":" in replies |\n| `/help` | Show help |"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Chinese keywords also work: `列表` `帮助` `模型` `换模型`"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"### Active Push"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"**Cordis service** (other plugins):"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**HTTP route** (scripts / schedulers):"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Agent tool**: `push_weixin` is registered automatically for scheduled tasks / alerts."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"### State Directory"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### Security Notes"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"> ⚠️ The `/weixin` panel has **no authentication**. Only run `dsh web` on trusted networks."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"- Bind to `127.0.0.1` or use a reverse proxy with auth if exposing remotely\n- Credentials are stored"},{"id":"p47s2","text":" with `0600` permissions and atomic writes\n- Image injection is vision-model aware: if the current m"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"odel doesn't support images, the image is skipped to avoid polluting history"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"### Message Type Support"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"| Type | Status |"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"| Text | ✅ Full support |\n| Voice | ✅ Tencent server-side ASR → text injection |\n| Image | ✅ CDN dow"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"nload → AES decrypt → attachment (vision-model aware) |\n| File / Video / Others | ❌ Not supported (f"},{"id":"p50s3","text":" → attachment (vision-model aware) |\n| File / Video / Others | ❌ Not supported (friendly fallback) |"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"### 功能特性"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"- **多会话**：一个微信用户可拥有多个独立会话，`/2` 或 `#工作 帮我写周报` 快速切换\n- **斜杠命令**：`/new` `/list` `/use` `/model` `/rename"},{"id":"p52s2","text":"` `/del` `/tag` `/help`，无需打开网页\n- **每会话模型**：每个会话记忆自己的 `provider/model`，`/model 3` 切换，下一条生效\n- **并发安全**"},{"id":"p52s3","text":"：按用户入站排队，按消息 ID 收集回复，多用户多会话互不干扰\n- **富媒体**：文字、语音（腾讯服务端转写）、图片（视觉模型感知注入）\n- **打字指示**：AI 思考时显示「正在输入…」\n- *"},{"id":"p52s4","text":"*主动推送**：`ctx.weixin.push()` + `/weixin/send` HTTP 路由 + `push_weixin` 工具\n- **安全默认**：凭据 `0600` 权限存储，原子"},{"id":"p52s5","text":"ctx.weixin.push()` + `/weixin/send` HTTP 路由 + `push_weixin` 工具\n- **安全默认**：凭据 `0600` 权限存储，原子写入，限流指数退避"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
